messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 18 00}Awww! I said you could bring
up anything BUT a bunch of
sappy love talk!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 18 00}Ohh! Ma ütlesin, et võid
rääkida kõigest PEALE
nutuse armujutu!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}What's the matter?!{01 00 00 0f 00}
You scared of talking
about mushy stuff?
{01 00 00 0f 00}{07 03 00}Yep, I can see the fear of
marriage in your eyes,
weasel boy!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}Mis lahti?!{01 00 00 0f 00}
Kas sa kardad rääkida
nutustest asjadest?
{01 00 00 0f 00}{07 03 00}Jah, ma näen su silmis
abielu hirmu,
nirgipoiss!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 15 00}It doesn't mean anything!{01 00 00 14 00}
It just popped into my
head just then!
It must be because you{01 00 00 05 00}
looked like one there for
a second!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 15 00}See ei tähenda midagi!{01 00 00 14 00}
See lihtsalt hüppas mulle
just pähe!
Vist sellepärast, et sa{01 00 00 05 00}
nägid hetkeks
nirgi moodi välja!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{07 14 00}Ha! I knew it, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!
{07 00 00}It's 'cause your head is
shaped kinda like a pear!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Ha! Ma teadsin, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!
{07 00 00}Sest su pea on kuidagi
pirni kujuga!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{07 04 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 05 00} you're not
into pears?{01 01 00} {07 0b 00}They ARE kinda
weird looking.{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{07 04 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 05 00} sulle ei
meeldi pirnid?{01 01 00} {07 0b 00}Nad ON pisut
veidra välimusega.{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}You idiot!{01 00 00 0f 00} {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}
totally sees{01 00 00 05 00} how stupid
you're being!{09 08 00}
{07 15 00}Besides, we all know that{01 00 00 05 00}
you secretly eat a bunch
of fancy, expensive food.
{07 01 00}That's where your story
crumbles, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{09 07 00}Sa tolvan!{01 00 00 0f 00} {0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}
näeb täiesti{01 00 00 05 00}, kui rumal
sa oled!{09 08 00}
{07 15 00}Pealegi teame me kõik, et{01 00 00 05 00}
sa sööd salaja hunniku
uhket, kallist toitu.
{07 01 00}Just seal su lugu
laguneb, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 02 00}{01 04 00}What? {01 00 00 05 00}{01 05 00}{07 00 00}{09 06 00}What did you say?!{01 00 00 0f 00}
How dare you!

{07 01 00}I'm very careful about what
I eat.{09 01 00}{07 18 00}{09 02 00}

{07 00 00}When you eat something
vibrant and colorful, you
naturally feel that way!{07 03 00}
Maybe the reason you're so
stale and tasteless is
because your food is too!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 02 00}{01 04 00}Mida? {01 00 00 05 00}{01 05 00}{07 00 00}{09 06 00}Mida sa ütlesid?!{01 00 00 0f 00}
Kuidas sa julged!

{07 01 00}Ma olen väga hoolikas
selle osas, mida söön.{09 01 00}{07 18 00}{09 02 00}

{07 00 00}Kui sa sööd midagi erksat
ja värvilist, tunned sa
end loomulikult samamoodi!{07 03 00}
Ehk oled sa nii lääge ja
maitsetu sellepärast,
et su toit on ka!{09 09 00}
